    "description": "This API provides access to seatmap information for airline flights, allowing users to visualize the seating layout and availability. By fetching the seatmap data, travel agents and airline personnel can assist customers in selecting their preferred seats, ensuring a smooth travel experience. The API is designed for integration into booking platforms, enhancing customer engagement and satisfaction. Typical consumers include airline software developers, travel agencies, and online booking systems looking to provide detailed flight seating options.",
